From 928f0273b8a71089e359d2e6e82a6b0da4af9d52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harshkamdar67 <harshkamdar67@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:21:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 16/32] ggml, vulkan: fused Inkling 2 short convolution

GGML_OP_INKLING_CONV computes scale*(cur + sum_k w[k]*x[t+k]) over x = [past; cur] and also
writes x, from which the recurrent state is stored as before (including the rollback slots).
Replaces the concat, ssm_conv, residual add and scale for the static-tap convolutions.
B60: decode 39.1 -> 40.7, two-token steps 65.2 -> 67.0, pp512 1278 -> 1293 tok/s;
wikitext-2 PPL at ubatch 16 (state carried across ubatches) 6.6194 unfused, 6.6240 fused.
